    "section_cF3GM6": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Tmzim4": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Still have questions? Reach out to us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@goluvora.com\" title=\"mailto:support@goluvora.com\">support@mineblock.co</a> — we’re here to help.</p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_jG9Kw9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_nyfWy9": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What are the chances of discovering a block?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_ignjJx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The mathematical probability of discovering a block with a single hobbyist device is <strong>extremely low</strong>. This device should be viewed as a \"lottery-style\" participant in the network. While individual hobbyists have successfully solved blocks in the past, it is not a predictable source of income.</p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_ignjJx"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_8QG6nw": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does buying more miners improve my chances?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_K3WTgV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Each device operates as an independent node attempting to solve a hash. Operating multiple devices increases your total hash rate, which proportionally increases your statistical probability of block discovery.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
